Mawaqit Home uses the following third-party services and libraries:

- Open-Meteo weather data (https://open-meteo.com) - CC BY 4.0, attribution required
- Aladhan prayer-times API (https://aladhan.com) - fallback source for prayer times
- Mawaqit (https://mawaqit.net) - the live prayer-times page shown as the background;
  its content belongs to its owners and is not part of this repository.
- ipwho.is / ipapi.co - approximate IP geolocation for the weather location

Fonts (bundled in app/src/main/assets/fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1; license texts alongside):
  Tajawal (Boutros International), Almarai (Almarai), Amiri (The Amiri Project Authors),
